WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.600
Welcome to Water Workforce 360.

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.780
Today you will record application steps

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.870
so your team can follow a real

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:07.870
procedure.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.280
Open Document Studio from Content.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.140
Choose Record tutorial.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.510
Pick a capture mode.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.510
Screen plus mic works for most plant

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.210
walkthroughs.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.980
Screenshots only works when video is

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:18.510
blocked.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.730
Start recording.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.440
Click through the application the way

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.290
you would on the job.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.040
Each click becomes a step.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.910
Stop when the procedure is done.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.430
Review the step list.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:28.780
Fix captions.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.380
Add callouts where someone might get

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:30.890
stuck.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.110
Generate the written guide, then save or

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.790
submit for your manager to publish.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.610
That tutorial now lives in your district

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:37.160
library.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.690
Staff can replay it anytime.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.650
Partners can also ship short avatar

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.700
videos for the same topic when you want

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.320
a face-to-camera overview.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.110
You just turned tribal knowledge into a

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.100
reusable lesson.
